{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_industry_and_packs_plan_two_axis_architecture", "label": "Two-axis Industries \u00d7 Packs architecture", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/industry-and-packs-plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Every Pack belongs to \u22651 Industry and every Industry uses \u22651 Pack, creating a dense internal-link graph for SEO and letting visitors navigate from 'I am X' to 'I need Y'."}, {"id": "docs_industry_and_packs_plan_url_structure", "label": "/industries/<slug> and /solutions/<slug> URL structure", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/industry-and-packs-plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "\"Solutions\" over \"/packs/\" because it is a higher-intent search term matching B2B SaaS convention (Razorpay, Cashfree, Setu); \"Pack\" stays as the on-page brand."}, {"id": "docs_industry_and_packs_plan_industry_page_template", "label": "Industry detail page template", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/industry-and-packs-plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A visitor arriving from search must immediately see (a) we serve you, (b) the exact recommended bundle, (c) what peers build, (d) how to start. 'Recommended solution packs' is the most important section \u2014 it bridges Industry \u2192 Pack \u2192 API."}, {"id": "docs_industry_and_packs_plan_solution_pack_template", "label": "Solution/Pack detail page template", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/industry-and-packs-plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Answers what's in the box, the job it does, the commercial model, and which industries use it \u2014 the 'what's inside the pack' rows explain why each API is pre